  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n1. + and × \n\n15 ÷ 5 + 27 × 3 - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**15 ÷ 5**__ + __**27 **____**×**____** 3**__ - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**3 + 81**__ - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**84 - 9**__ = 51\n\n⇒ 75 ≠ 51\n\n2. ÷ and × \n\n15 × __**5 ÷ 27**__ + 3 - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**15 **____**× 0.18**__ + 3 - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**2.7 + 3**__ - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**5.7 - 9**__ = 51\n\n⇒ -3.3 ≠ 51\n\n3. ÷ and + \n\n15 + 5 × __**27 ÷ 3**__ - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ 15 + __**5 × 9**__ - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**15 +**____** 45**__ - 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**60 - 9**__ = 51 \n\n⇒ 51 = 51 \n\n4. + and - \n\n__**15 ÷ 5**__ × 27 - 3 + 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**3 × 27**__ - 3 + 9 = 51\n\n⇒ __**81**__ - 3 __**+**____** 9**__ = 51\n\n⇒ __**90 -**____** 3**__ = 51\n\n⇒ 87 ≠ 51\n\nHence, '**÷ and +**' is the correct answer.",
